10">I'm </span><span begin="00:22.410" end="00:23.080">not </span><span begin="00:23.080" end="00:24.951">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.660" end="00:29.100"><span begin="00:24.660" end="00:25.200">Didn't </span><span begin="00:25.200" end="00:25.880">you </span><span begin="00:25.880" end="00:26.290">feel </span><span begin="00:26.290" end="00:26.760">me </span><span begin="00:26.760" end="00:27.040">lock </span><span begin="00:27.040" end="00:27.410">my </span><span begin="00:27.410" end="00:27.820">arms </span><span begin="00:27.820" end="00:28.070">around </span><span begin="00:28.070" end="00:29.099">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.800" end="00:31.820"><span begin="00:28.800" end="00:29.440">Why'd </span><span begin="00:29.440" end="00:29.710">you </span><span begin="00:29.710" end="00:30.190">turn </span><span begin="00:30.190" end="00:31.814">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.520" end="00:37.410"><span begin="00:31.520" end="00:32.140">Here's </span><span begin="00:32.140" end="00:32.440">what </span><span begin="00:32.440" end="00:32.690">I </span><span begin="00:32.690" end="00:33.060">have </span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:33.290">to </span><span begin="00:33.290" end="00:35.590">say </span><span begin="00:35.590" end="00:35.900">I </span><span begin="00:35.900" end="00:36.080">was </span><span begin="00:36.080" end="00:36.340">left </span><span begin="00:36.340" end="00:36.570">to </span><span begin="00:36.570" end="00:37.000">cry </span><span begin="00:37.000" end="00:37.402">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.110" end="00:40.900"><span begin="00:37.110" end="00:37.630">Waiting </span><span begin="00:37.630" end="00:38.150">outside </span><span begin="00:38.150" end="00:38.970">there </span><span begin="00:38.970" end="00:39.270">grinning </span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.490">with </span><span begin="00:39.490" end="00:39.760">a </span><span begin="00:39.760" end="00:40.130">lost </span><s